(4369, 141, 'Many companies now have employee assistance programs that enable employees, free of charge, to improve their physical fitness, reduce stress, and learn ways to stop smoking. These programs increase worker productivity, reduce absenteeism and lessen insurance costs for employee health care. Therefore, these programs benefit the company as well as the employee. Which of the following, if true, most significantly strengthens the conclusion above?', 'Physical fitness programs are often the most popular services offered to employees.', NULL, 'Studies have shown that training in stress management is not effective for many people.', NULL, 'Regular exercise reduces people risk of heart disease and provides them with increased energy.', NULL, 'Employee assistance programs require companies to hire people to supervise the various programs offered.', NULL, 'C', 'Regular exercise reduces people risk of heart disease and provides them with increased energy - এটি কর্মীদের সুস্থতা ও কর্মক্ষমতা বাড়ায়, যা কোম্পানির জন্যও লাভজনক।', NULL, 168, '18th BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'd9df82b1da968b91c4f7c763d312c863'),
(4370, 141, 'Choose the answer that is closest in meaning of the following sentence: Despite the great difference in size, shape and function, all human cells have the same 46 chromosomes.', 'All human cells are the same because the 46 chromosomes govern size, shape and function.', NULL, 'Difference in size, shape and function are not very great because all human cells have the same 46 chromosomes.', NULL, 'The size, shape and function of human cells are the same, but the 46 Chromosomes are different.', NULL, 'Although the 46 chromosomes are the same in all human cells, there are differences in the size, shape and function.', NULL, 'D', 'Despite (সত্ত্বেও) দ্বারা দুটি বিপরীত অর্থ প্রকাশ পায়। অর্থ: সকল মানবকোষে ৪৬টি ক্রোমোজোম একই থাকলেও আকার, আকৃতি ও কাজের পার্থক্য রয়েছে।', NULL, 168, '18th BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '4b49a8f1cdfc4f5136971f1778957a58'),
(4371, 140, 'INFRINGE means-', 'Transgress', NULL, 'Purloin', NULL, 'Invade', NULL, 'Intrude', NULL, 'A', 'Infringe – ভঙ্গ করা, লঙ্ঘন করা, অতিক্রম করা। Transgress – লঙ্ঘন করা, ভঙ্গ করা (সমার্থক)। Purloin – চুরি করা। Invade – হামলা করা, হানা দেওয়া। Intrude – জোর করে প্রবেশ করা।', NULL, 168, '18th BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '09b9022476faf2515b2418ed8deb67ba'),
(4372, 140, 'BROCHURE means-', 'Opening', NULL, 'Pamphlet', NULL, 'Bureau', NULL, 'Censor', NULL, 'B', 'Brochure – (সংক্ষিপ্ত বিবরণ সমৃদ্ধ) পুস্তিকা। Pamphlet – পুস্তিকা (সমার্থক)। Opening-উদ্বোধন, সূচনা। Bureau – দফতর। Censor – কেটে বাদ দেয়া, পরীক্ষা করা।', NULL, 168, '18th BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'c38e1721b44323c951bb141eaf1863d2'),
(4373, 140, 'EQUIVOCAL means-', 'Universal', NULL, 'Mistaken', NULL, 'Quaint', NULL, 'Clear', NULL, 'D', 'Equivocal-দ্ব্যর্থবোধক, অস্পষ্ট, সন্দেহজনক। Clear – স্পষ্ট, স্বচ্ছ (বিপরীতার্থক)। Universal – সার্বজনীন। Mistaken – ভ্রান্ত, ভ্রমাত্মক। Quaint – খেয়ালী।', NULL, 168, '18th BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'a7461e52aa436d02ee6f4092b4b30f72'),
(4374, 140, 'ILLUSIVE means-', 'Not deceptive', NULL, 'Not certain', NULL, 'Not obvious', NULL, 'Not coherent', NULL, 'B', 'Illusive – অলীক, ইন্দ্রজালিক, মায়াবী। Not Certain – অনিশ্চিত, সন্দেহপূর্ণ। Not deceptive – ভ্রান্তিকর নয়। Not obvious – স্পষ্ট নয়। Not coherent – অসঙ্গতিপূর্ণ।', NULL, 168, '18th BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '4cbe83052973904256f063e8c81abbf2'),
