(4445, 140, 'The word Euphemism means', 'Stating one thing like another', NULL, 'Description of a disagreeable thing by an agreeable name', NULL, 'Contrast of words is made in the same sentence', NULL, 'A statement is made emphatic by overstatement', NULL, 'B', 'Euphemism- সুভাষণ, রূঢ় শব্দের পরিবর্তে সমার্থক সুন্দর শব্দ/শব্দগুচ্ছ ব্যবহার। Description of a disagreeable thing by an agreeable name.', NULL, 3, '20th BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '52c821b9f34d01a551b3f95a690784f8'),
(4446, 139, 'The passive form of the sentence Some children were helping the wounded man', 'The wounded man was helped by some children', NULL, 'The wounded man was helping by some children', NULL, 'The wounded man was being helped by some children', NULL, 'The wounded man was to be helped by some children', NULL, 'C', 'Past Continuous Tense এর Passive: Subject + was/were + being + V(past participle) + by + object. তাই The wounded man was being helped by some children।', NULL, 3, '20th BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'f5754ea072c9dd5edf08c99dfebfa4e9'),
(4447, 141, 'The author is mainly concerned with', 'the nature of rumor', NULL, 'the fascination of rumors', NULL, 'rumor as primitive mans newspaper', NULL, 'the breeding places of rumors', NULL, 'A', 'Reading Comprehension প্রশ্ন। লেখক মূলত গুজবের প্রকৃতি (the nature of rumor) নিয়ে আলোচনা করেছেন।', NULL, 3, '20th BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'b47c19ad0c830d6471a6776a4effbb9b'),
(4448, 141, 'The author suggests that rumors usually', 'alarm their hearers', NULL, 'are hardy in their growth', NULL, 'are disheartening', NULL, 'can be suppressed by censorship', NULL, 'B', 'Reading Comprehension প্রশ্ন। লেখক বলেছেন গুজব সাধারণত দৃঢ়ভাবে বৃদ্ধি পায় (are hardy in their growth)।', NULL, 3, '20th BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'f8c855fc656d4690e9f0e8bdabe58a2a'),
(4449, 141, 'The author states that during war time the regular sources of news present only', 'optimistic reports', NULL, 'pessimistic reports', NULL, 'limited information', NULL, 'government propaganda', NULL, 'C', 'Reading Comprehension প্রশ্ন। যুদ্ধকালীন সময়ে সংবাদের নিয়মিত উৎস শুধু সীমিত তথ্য (limited information) উপস্থাপন করে।', NULL, 3, '20th BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'ee60d3d0cd0e057a3aabd534ad2c7559'),
(4450, 141, 'Which of the following best describes the author personal attitude toward rumor?', 'Excited enthusiasm', NULL, 'Morbid curiosity', NULL, 'Acute indignation', NULL, 'Philosophical interest', NULL, 'D', 'Reading Comprehension প্রশ্ন। লেখকের গুজবের প্রতি দার্শনিক আগ্রহ (Philosophical interest) ছিল।', NULL, 3, '20th BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '118c53c0b40ddd978438c7cc3a069abd'),
(4451, 140, 'Lengthen : Prolong', 'stretch : extend', NULL, 'distance : reduce', NULL, 'draw out : shorten', NULL, 'reach out : cut short', NULL, 'A', 'Lengthen এবং Prolong উভয়ই অর্থ \"দীর্ঘ করা\" - সমার্থক। Stretch এবং Extend-ও সমার্থক।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '5d2562f374d9670d521150b452991286'),
(4452, 140, 'Delay : Retard', 'postpone : promote', NULL, 'adjourn : start', NULL, 'slow down : hold up', NULL, 'defer : accelerate', NULL, 'C', 'Delay এবং Retard উভয়ই অর্থ \"বিলম্ব করা\" - সমার্থক। Slow down এবং Hold up-ও সমার্থক।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '9c8e9cbb3b2ed909e39802b9f2124420'),
(4453, 140, 'Submissive : Disobedient', 'comply : conform', NULL, 'heed : acquiesce', NULL, 'observe : defy', NULL, 'obey : hearken to', NULL, 'C', 'Submissive (বাধ্য) এবং Disobedient (অবাধ্য) - বিপরীতার্থক। Observe (মেনে চলা) এবং Defy (অমান্য করা) - বিপরীতার্থক।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '5b4c7c475390653017f85b3281999a9b'),
(4454, 131, 'He fantasized ____ winning the lottery.', 'with', NULL, 'from', NULL, 'after', NULL, 'about', NULL, 'D', 'Fantasize about - কল্পনা করা (কোনো ঘটনা/বস্তু সম্পর্কে)।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '2fdf66a04f97f4d19fc630c4e861777d'),
(4455, 139, 'The Parthenon is said ____ erected in the Age of Pericles.', 'to have become', NULL, 'to have begun', NULL, 'to have been', NULL, 'to have had begun', NULL, 'C', 'কোনো sentence এ অতীতকালের উল্লেখ থাকলে বা কোন কাজ অতীতে সম্পন্ন হয়েছিল বোঝালে simple infinitive এর পরিবর্তে perfect infinitive বসে। যেহেতু passive sentence সেহেতু perfect infinitive এর passive form - \"to have been\"।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '309c58b2c179ad089659b47523f91b69'),
(4456, 131, 'He divided the money ____ the two children.', 'among', NULL, 'between', NULL, 'in between', NULL, 'over', NULL, 'B', 'দুইয়ের মধ্যে বুঝালে Between হবে এবং অনেকের মধ্যে বুঝালে Among হবে। এখানে দুই জন child।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '0f724d203a1b330d76206f4619e40071'),
(4457, 139, 'As they waited Rahim argued against war–', 'While his brother discusses the effects of pollution', NULL, 'While his brother discussed the effects of pollution', NULL, 'While his brother was discussing the effects of pollution', NULL, 'While his brother had discussed the effects of pollution', NULL, 'C', 'While দ্বারা কোনো Sentence বা Clause শুরু হলে While এর পরেই subject থাকলে Verb এর Past Continuous হয়।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '7f6cfe5fcb349dbaa54176edb0f347ac'),
(4458, 140, 'If we want concrete proof, we are looking for ____.', 'clear evidence', NULL, 'building material', NULL, 'a cement mixer', NULL, 'something to cover a path', NULL, 'A', 'Concrete Proof এর অর্থ: বাস্তব/সঠিক প্রমাণ। Clear evidence - স্পষ্ট প্রমাণ।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '42017df0d0f31dae097aa94c1cd16282'),
(4459, 140, 'The Olympic games were watched by ___ billions people all over the world.', 'exactly', NULL, 'usually', NULL, 'truly', NULL, 'literally', NULL, 'D', 'Literally - আক্ষরিক অর্থে, মোটামুটি। বিলিয়ন বিলিয়ন লোক দেখেছে - এ অর্থে literally সঠিক।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '562935a1b8a5ae0380253d12df1935ca'),
(4460, 141, 'The author thinks that true learning will lead to ___.', 'personal understanding of the ideas or writers', NULL, 'discovery of the unknown world', NULL, 'revelation of the mysteries of the world', NULL, 'better expressive powers', NULL, 'A', 'Reading Comprehension প্রশ্ন। প্রকৃত শিক্ষা লেখকদের ধারণার ব্যক্তিগত উপলব্ধির দিকে নিয়ে যায়।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '22be3e4d595635c665152263a43a4653'),
(4461, 141, 'Which of the following best describes the author attitude towards learning?', 'Learning is not a matter of reading extensively', NULL, 'Learning is not something to be demonstrated in examinations', NULL, 'Learning is a matter of promoting creativity in students.', NULL, 'Learning is a matter of memorization', NULL, 'C', 'শিক্ষা হলো সেটাই যা ছাত্র-ছাত্রীদের মধ্যে creativity (সৃজনশীলতা) বৃদ্ধি করে।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '339f6ad6f34c5b669f23b5ec7944b65b'),
(4462, 141, 'The gypsies are people who ____.', 'have a settled way of life.', NULL, 'came originally from Egypt to England', NULL, 'are always on the move', NULL, 'steal children to train them in the way of life', NULL, 'C', 'Passage-এ বলা হয়েছে, \"They do not have any fixed home, but wander about from place to place\" - তারা সবসময় চলাফেরা করে।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'c28ebbe6866df0b493069f331a15830a'),
(4463, 141, 'The gypsies like to live in tents because ____.', 'it is easy to hide stolen children in a tent', NULL, 'it is easy to read one palm inside a tent', NULL, 'it is easy to bring them from Egypt', NULL, 'it is easy to pitch them', NULL, 'D', 'যেকোনো বাসস্থানের চেয়ে তাঁবু স্থাপন করা সহজ - কারণ তারা ঘুরে বেড়ায়।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'd39cecfe04d82db021b36dc4dca20f58'),
(4464, 141, 'The English took them for Egyptians means-', 'The English took them to the Egyptians', NULL, 'The English considered them to be Egyptians', NULL, 'The English were taken in by the Egyptians', NULL, 'The English brought them as far as to Egypt', NULL, 'B', 'The English took them for Egyptians - অর্থ: ইংরেজরা তাদেরকে মিশরীয় মনে করত। Considered = মনে করা।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '70bb9eb6faddaf33dfea3b9e94469a0b'),
(4465, 141, 'Attitude towards the gypsies ____.', 'are still the same as before', NULL, 'have not much changed over the years', NULL, 'can change once they stop stealing children', NULL, 'have shown signs of change', NULL, 'D', 'Passage-এর শেষ লাইনে বলা হয়েছে: \"But this attitude towards the gypsies has gradually changed.\" - পরিবর্তনের ইঙ্গিত বহন করছে।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'e859bfba416a5909465184430b293b5b'),
(4466, 133, 'The tree has been blown ___ by the strong wind.', 'away', NULL, 'up', NULL, 'off', NULL, 'out', NULL, 'A', 'Blown away - উড়িয়ে নিয়ে যাওয়া। প্রবল বাতাসে গাছ উড়িয়ে নিয়ে গেছে।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '2e97856d86da65c37b2aa898d5a9102b'),
(4467, 140, 'No one can ___ that he is clever.', 'defy', NULL, 'admire', NULL, 'deny', NULL, 'denounce', NULL, 'C', 'Deny - অস্বীকার করা। অর্থ: কেউ অস্বীকার করতে পারে না যে সে চতুর।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'a0cfc0f8956770227028ce419b2b27b1'),
(4468, 138, 'A reward has been announced for the employees who ___ hard.', 'have worked', NULL, 'has worked', NULL, 'will be work', NULL, 'have had worked', NULL, 'A', 'Who এর antecedent হলো The employees (plural)। তাই verb-ও plural - have worked।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'a5b02dba2e73e8d95db6ce03f4d8cf92'),
(4469, 139, 'To ___ the arrival of spring, Bangladesh Television ____ a special function.', 'Commemorate : launched', NULL, 'Announce : telecast', NULL, 'Celebrate : organized', NULL, 'Welcome : sanctioned', NULL, 'C', 'বসন্তের আগমন উদযাপন করতে বাংলাদেশ টেলিভিশন একটি বিশেষ অনুষ্ঠানের আয়োজন করে। Celebrate : organized - যথার্থ।', NULL, 170, '21st BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'b6a0a75dc11ffc783da76c834ff273c9'),
(4470, 131, 'He has paid the penalty ___ his crimes ___ five years in prison.', 'for, with', NULL, 'at, by', NULL, 'about, at', NULL, 'after, in', NULL, 'A', 'paid for + something/action - পুরস্কার/শাস্তি প্রদান। ৫ বছর কারাদণ্ড সহ-অর্থে five years-এর পূর্বে with বসবে।', NULL, 171, '22nd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '2ef7071dbc55a44b2e0cf05eb7e7b76e'),
(4471, 138, 'The path ____ paved, so we were able to walk through the path.', 'was', NULL, 'had been', NULL, 'has been', NULL, 'being', NULL, 'B', 'বাক্যে past tense-এ দুটি clause রয়েছে। পূর্বে সংগঠিত কাজটির হবে Past Perfect Tense আর পরেরটি হবে Past Indefinite. রাস্তাটি পাকা করার কাজটি আগে হয়েছিল - The path had been paved.', NULL, 171, '22nd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '9bff7c4a8803d77150a27f3b8adecb68'),
(4472, 133, 'In spite of my requests, he did not ____.', 'give in', NULL, 'fall in', NULL, 'get off', NULL, 'give forth', NULL, 'A', 'Give in - আত্মসমর্পণ করা; বশ্যতা স্বীকার করা। Fall in - ভেঙে পড়া, সারি বেধে দাঁড়ানো। Get off - যাত্রা করা, রওনা দেয়া। Give forth - উদগীরণ করা, নিঃসৃত করা। Give in দিয়েই বাক্যটি অর্থবোধক হয় - আমার অনুরোধ সত্ত্বেও সে বশ্যতা স্বীকার করেনি।', NULL, 171, '22nd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '44834a98b09328e11869e1859fb45626'),
(4473, 127, 'The children studied in a classroom ____ windows were never opened.', 'that', NULL, 'which', NULL, 'where', NULL, 'whose', NULL, 'D', 'শূন্যস্থানের পূর্বে room এবং পরে window থাকায় এদের মধ্যে সম্পর্ক বোঝাচ্ছে। Relative pronoun এর possessive form হচ্ছে whose (যার)।', NULL, 171, '22nd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'b47725f9d3603bcf1032f5b77ba4b404'),
(4474, 140, 'We should have a balanced ____.', 'food', NULL, 'diet', NULL, 'outlook', NULL, 'figure', NULL, 'B', 'Have অর্থ খাওয়া। Balanced diet - সুষম খাদ্য। Food-এর আগে a বসানো যায় না, diet-এর আগে বসে।', NULL, 171, '22nd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '023e6d5e984a8f6a1fea2b053f79626b'),
(4475, 133, 'We kept our fingers ____.', 'raised', NULL, 'pointed', NULL, 'lifted', NULL, 'crossed', NULL, 'D', 'Keep one\'s fingers crossed - আশা পোষণ করা, কামনা করা। সঠিক বানান crossed (cressed নয়)।', NULL, 171, '22nd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '35ace1094fed3affce504f9244600683'),
(4476, 140, 'The man ____ never to tell a lie.', 'pledged', NULL, 'disavowed', NULL, 'provided', NULL, 'deferred', NULL, 'A', 'Pledge - অঙ্গীকার করা, প্রতিজ্ঞা করা। Disavow - অস্বীকার করা। Provide - সরবরাহ করা। Defer - বিলম্বিত করা। অর্থানুসারে pledged-ই appropriate।', NULL, 171, '22nd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'c6057fb144db6fe1b8312e538d6ec402'),
(4477, 140, 'Cul-de-sac means ____.', 'Selection', NULL, 'Dead end', NULL, 'Error', NULL, 'Bubble', NULL, 'B', 'Cul-de-sac একটি ফরাসি শব্দ, যার অর্থ কানাগলি (Dead end)।', NULL, 171, '22nd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '04a143b8c398d263f572d2d91782debb'),
(4478, 140, 'Parcel means ____.', 'Quarrel', NULL, 'Postage', NULL, 'Piece of land', NULL, 'Unobstructed view', NULL, 'C', 'Parcel অর্থ মোড়ক, এর আরেক অর্থ এক খণ্ড জমি (Piece of land)।', NULL, 171, '22nd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '24f688c4ee5fafd26cf875e7eecb5133'),
(4479, 140, 'Ruminant means ____.', 'Cud-chewing animal', NULL, 'Soup', NULL, 'Gossip', NULL, 'Noise-maker', NULL, 'A', 'Ruminant অর্থ জাবর কাটা প্রাণী (Cud-chewing animal)।', NULL, 171, '22nd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'ca803d955f4dda66e8bfe58b35ab0ede'),
(4480, 141, 'On the face of it, telescopes and data bases sound like very different things. Telescopes sit on the top of mountains, and are pointed at the skies; data bases sit on computer hard disks, humming away and going no where. Yet they have something in common; both allow astronomers to explore the universe. Modern telescopes are highly automated pieces of machinery equipped with digital sensors that produce reams of observational data. Such data can be stored, processed and distributed just like other digital information. This means it is no longer necessary for astronomer actually to visit a telescope to make observation. Which is correct?', 'Telescopes and data bases complement each other for the astronomer', NULL, 'Telescopes and data bases are both becoming relevant for the astronomer', NULL, 'Telescopes and data bases have nothing in common for the astronomer', NULL, 'Telescopes and data bases can be confusing to the astronomer', NULL, 'A', 'টেলিস্কোপ এবং ডেটাবেস উভয়ই পরস্পর পূরক। একটির কাজ অপরটির দ্বারা করা সম্ভব।', NULL, 171, '22nd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '6f6fb6cb2ebabd60d92dc861cbbf2985'),
(4481, 141, 'On the face of it, telescopes and data bases sound like very different things. Telescopes sit on the top of mountains, and are pointed at the skies; data bases sit on computer hard disks, humming away and going no where. Yet they have something in common; both allow astronomers to explore the universe. Modern telescopes are highly automated pieces of machinery equipped with digital sensors that produce reams of observational data. Such data can be stored, processed and distributed just like other digital information. This means it is no longer necessary for astronomer actually to visit a telescope to make observation.', 'Data bases are singing instrument', NULL, 'Data bases are useless and static', NULL, 'Data bases make soft-sound but are working away', NULL, 'Data bases are things of the past', NULL, 'C', 'Humming away অর্থ অনবরত গুণগুণ করে কাজ করে চলে। Data bases মৃদু আওয়াজ সৃষ্টি করে; কাজ করে চলে।', NULL, 171, '22nd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '39ad41ae08d3553f17ce9489e6453b64'),
(4482, 141, 'On the face of it, telescopes and data bases sound like very different things. Telescopes sit on the top of mountains, and are pointed at the skies; data bases sit on computer hard disks, humming away and going no where. Yet they have something in common; both allow astronomers to explore the universe. Modern telescopes are highly automated pieces of machinery equipped with digital sensors that produce reams of observational data. Such data can be stored, processed and distributed just like other digital information. This means it is no longer necessary for astronomer actually to visit a telescope to make observation.', 'Data bases produce a lot of information', NULL, 'Data bases are packed with paper', NULL, 'Data bases create information instantly', NULL, 'Data bases are of limited use in strong information', NULL, 'A', 'Produce reams of observational data - এতে reams অর্থ ভুরিভুরি, প্রচুর। Data bases প্রচুর তথ্য তৈরি করে (a lot of information)।', NULL, 171, '22nd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '125a9f95ca7c6a0b7c1a0fdb04b1962d'),
(4483, 141, 'On the face of it, telescopes and data bases sound like very different things. Telescopes sit on the top of mountains, and are pointed at the skies; data bases sit on computer hard disks, humming away and going no where. Yet they have something in common; both allow astronomers to explore the universe. Modern telescopes are highly automated pieces of machinery equipped with digital sensors that produce reams of observational data. Such data can be stored, processed and distributed just like other digital information. This means it is no longer necessary for astronomer actually to visit a telescope to make observation. Which is correct?', 'The contemporary astronomer needs to look at the sky from a mountain top.', NULL, 'The contemporary astronomer needs a telescope to explore the universe.', NULL, 'The contemporary astronomer needs heavy machinery to explore the universe.', NULL, 'The contemporary astronomer needs a telescope equipped with digital sensors to explore the universe.', NULL, 'D', 'Passage-এ বলা হয়েছে - Modern telescopes are highly automated pieces of machinery equipped with digital sensors. অর্থাৎ digital sensor যুক্ত telescope প্রয়োজন।', NULL, 171, '22nd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '055953e3606c6d607ceaf2ed8780d265'),
(4484, 141, 'On the face of it, telescopes and data bases sound like very different things. Telescopes sit on the top of mountains, and are pointed at the skies; data bases sit on computer hard disks, humming away and going no where. Yet they have something in common; both allow astronomers to explore the universe. Modern telescopes are highly automated pieces of machinery equipped with digital sensors that produce reams of observational data. Such data can be stored, processed and distributed just like other digital information. This means it is no longer necessary for astronomer actually to visit a telescope to make observation.', 'Telescope and exploration of the universe.', NULL, 'Digital telescope and exploration of the universe.', NULL, 'Astronomers and exploration of the universe.', NULL, 'Space exploration in the new millennium.', NULL, 'B', 'আধুনিক টেলিস্কোপে Astronomer-এর উপস্থিতি ছাড়াই digital sensor যুক্ত করার মাধ্যমে তথ্য সংগ্রহ ও সংরক্ষণ করা যায়। অর্থাৎ Digital telescope and exploration of the universe.', NULL, 171, '22nd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '55a8a95ab524f2f4b2c2e181f27c929d'),
(4485, 140, 'Question', 'Subjection … Liberation', NULL, 'Restrain …. Indulge', NULL, 'Compliant ….. Acquiescent', NULL, 'D  Restriction … Relaxation', NULL, 'C', '', NULL, 171, '22nd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 2001, '2001-02-02', 'BPSC', '', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1AfA-MevyXXwTRW-l7ykU_EnhGojGVs0G/view?usp=sharing', '252f68dc5de448a2b7fcb60c62ff4168'),
(4486, 139, 'Complete the following sentence. If I had known you were coming–.', 'I would go the station', NULL, 'I had gone to the station', NULL, 'I would have gone to the station', NULL, 'I would be going to the station', NULL, 'C', 'Conditional sentence এর নিয়মানুযায়ী If + past perfect + would have/could have/might have হয়। যেহেতু main clause-এ past perfect tense হয়েছে তাই subordinate clause-এ would have ব্যবহার করতে হবে।', NULL, 172, '23rd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'c52240ba109882bbcfd4bf6fac0589f9'),
(4487, 139, 'Choose the correct option: Even as harvesting was going on –.', 'the rainy season began', NULL, 'the rainy season was began', NULL, 'the rainy season had began', NULL, 'the rainy season begins', NULL, 'A', 'Even as থাকলে উভয় Clause এ Past tense হবে।', NULL, 172, '23rd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '3566056132eeaf877801bef3f11cca58'),
(4488, 140, 'Which phrase contains words opposed to each other in meaning?', 'Hopes and aspiration', NULL, 'Heat and dust', NULL, 'Reproduction and death', NULL, 'Emerged and advanced', NULL, 'C', 'Reproduction (প্রজনন) এবং Death (মৃত্যু) - পরস্পর বিপরীতার্থক।', NULL, 172, '23rd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '7323abf7c77205ab2e28d054b4925fee'),
(4489, 141, 'Find out the correct translation. সকাল থেকে গুড়ি গুড়ি বৃষ্টি হচ্ছে।', 'It is raining from morning', NULL, 'It has been raining from morning', NULL, 'It has been drizzling since morning', NULL, 'It is drizzling since morning', NULL, 'C', 'Drizzling = গুঁড়ি গুঁড়ি বৃষ্টি হওয়া। Present perfect tense-এ যদি নির্দিষ্ট সময় বিন্দু বা point of time উল্লেখ থাকে (এখানে সকাল) তাহলে since বসে।', NULL, 172, '23rd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '05ea50c93045a07dcab466c23487a264'),
(4490, 133, 'Maiden speech means –.', 'First speech', NULL, 'Last speech', NULL, 'Late speech', NULL, 'Early speech', NULL, 'A', 'Maiden অর্থ সর্বপ্রথম। Maiden speech = প্রথম বক্তব্য = First speech.', NULL, 172, '23rd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '5d8ac50d9aa55f7c3cb90660734c6d8b'),
(4491, 133, 'A person whose head is in the clouds is –.', 'proud', NULL, 'a day dreamer', NULL, 'an aviator', NULL, 'useless', NULL, 'B', 'Have one\'s head in the clouds - দিবাস্বপ্নে বিভোর বা অলীক কল্পনায় মগ্ন। Day dreamer = দিবাস্বপ্নাচারী।', NULL, 172, '23rd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'cd0e128bcd88d1ba63abcf1b6bca413e'),
(4492, 139, 'Identify the correct sentence-', 'She had faith in and hopes for the future.', NULL, 'She had faith and hopes for the future.', NULL, 'She had faith and hopes in the future.', NULL, 'She had faith and hopes in future.', NULL, 'A', 'Faith in (বিশ্বাস) এবং hopes for (আশা) - দুটি ভিন্ন preposition সঠিকভাবে ব্যবহার করতে হলে \"faith in and hopes for\" হবে।', NULL, 172, '23rd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, 'a332ebc94204e104d0284729c5368c3a'),
(4493, 138, 'Choose the correct tense –', 'Javed was so exhausted that he lain down for a sleep.', NULL, 'Javed was so exhausted that he had laid down for a sleep.', NULL, 'Javed was so exhausted that he was lying down for a sleep.', NULL, 'Javed was so exhausted that he will lay down for a sleep.', NULL, 'C', 'উভয় clause একই tense এর হবে। Lie (শুয়ে থাকা) এর Past Continuous - was lying। Lay- ডিম পাড়া বা রাখা।', NULL, 172, '23rd BCS', '100-100', '100', 'N', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-10', 'softadmin', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', 2026, NULL, 'e360', NULL, NULL, '6953bda07ed13650894ba3049ed229eb'),
